{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JON","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约拿书","commonName":"约拿书","title":"约拿书","order":32,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"029ca4d2eb1b1c2cc0e47bf2fbd452a8a1c4e1a147cd781bd41c94fced3e200a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":48},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华第二次对约拿说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“你起身前往尼尼微大城，向那里的居民宣告我先前吩咐你的话。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["约拿便照耶和华的吩咐前往尼尼微城。尼尼微城很大，要三天才能走遍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["约拿进城走了一天，宣告说：“再过四十天尼尼微就要毁灭了！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["尼尼微城的人相信了上帝的话，便宣告禁食，所有的人，无论大小贵贱都披上麻衣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["尼尼微王听到这消息后，便走下宝座，脱下王袍，披上麻衣，坐在炉灰中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["王又向全城颁布通告，说：“王和大臣有令，所有的人都必须禁食，牛羊牲畜都不许吃草也不许喝水。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["人和牲畜都必须披上麻衣，众人要向上帝恳切呼求，改邪归正，停止作恶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["上帝或许会心生怜悯，收回烈怒，使我们不致灭亡，也未可知。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["上帝看见他们改邪归正，不再作恶，就心生怜悯，没有像所说的那样毁灭他们。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}